Update SystemDataTransferProcessor to retrieve and use the userId directly from the AssociationInfo instead of relying on the passed-in userId parameter. This ensures consistency and correctness when building permission transfer user consent intents and starting system data transfers.

Bug: 497659915
Test: CTS
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
Change-Id: I4083fb0866ae375c60e845ba72025538e727d8e4
(cherry picked from commit e4984771184f04c22c78525eea9f2a61938b71e8)

(cherry picked from commit 35f44ec9c1c78bac64d78940eba4c3929d39ea5d)
